{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Routes\n🛤️ The layers of Deltarune's alternate routes: Pacifist/Violent, the Sword Route (Ch.3), and the Weird Route (Ch.2, 4, and 5).","x":0,"y":0,"width":400,"height":190,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/routes.png","x":0,"y":-220,"width":190,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Sword Route (Ch.3)**\nRamb grants access to the Original Game after getting an S rank — culminates in the Shadow Mantle.","x":-1000,"y":320,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shadow_Mantle_holder_battle_idle.gif","x":-1000,"y":110,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Snowgrave (Ch.2)**\nThe origin of the Weird Route — freezing every enemy with IceShock unlocks the spell.","x":-650,"y":320,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_battle_SnowGrave.gif","x":-650,"y":110,"width":132,"height":180},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Noelle's House (Ch.4)**\nThe SOUL alone through the vents, the forced ThornRing, the beating in the bathroom.","x":-300,"y":320,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_screenshot_kicking_SOUL.png","x":-300,"y":110,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**The Lake ending (Ch.5)**\nThe culmination, for now: submersion and a cut to \"Chapter 7, Side B.\"","x":60,"y":320,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lake.png","x":60,"y":110,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Prophecy**\nEach route reinterprets differently the final sacrifice announced by the prophetic text.","x":420,"y":320,"width":300,"height":190,"color":"4"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Profecy.gif","x":420,"y":110,"width":180,"height":180},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Player**\nThe hidden-route system itself is direct proof of the tension between their choices and actual control over the story.","x":780,"y":320,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_SOUL.png","x":780,"y":110,"width":97,"height":180},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Ramb**\nGrants access to the Sword Route in Ch.3 — and upon completing it, appears half-petrified before disappearing.","x":-1000,"y":620,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Ramb.webp","x":-1000,"y":850,"width":138,"height":170},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**FRIEND**\nBearer of the Shadow Mantle in the battle that closes the Sword Route — their exact identity there still isn't fully confirmed.","x":-650,"y":620,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/FRIEND_screenshot_Shadow_Mantle_holder_battle.png","x":-650,"y":850,"width":180,"height":135},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**Noelle**\nThe most affected by the cumulative pattern — from Snowgrave to the Lake ending, no one racks up as many consequences as she does.","x":-300,"y":620,"width":300,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s8-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Noelle_overworld.png","x":-300,"y":850,"width":85,"height":170},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**Where is all this heading?**\nThe deliberate buildup, with no alternative \"good ending,\" suggests it's building toward a bigger consequence — possibly Ch.7, Side B.","x":60,"y":620,"width":300,"height":230,"color":"1"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_s0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s6-img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s8-img","fromNode":"s8-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_c_img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"cross_espada_ramb","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_espada_friend","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_snowgrave_noelle","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_casanoelle_noelle","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_lago_noelle","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_profecia_haciadonde","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s9","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_jugador_haciadonde","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s9","toSide":"left","color":"3"}]}